umber.","Mash chickpeas roughly with a fork and stir in lemon juice.","Add the vegetables and season to taste.","Fill the wraps, roll tightly and serve."],"tags":["Quick","Family"],"image":2},{"id":"rice-egg","name":"Vegetable egg rice","time":20,"appliances":["Hob"],"diet":"vegetarian","items":[["rice",60],["egg",2],["carrot",70],["pepper",60],["oil",5]],"steps":["Cook the rice following its packet instructions. Dice the vegetables and beat the eggs.","Warm the oil in a frying pan. Cook the diced vegetables until tender.","Push vegetables aside, add the beaten eggs and cook until set.","Add the freshly cooked rice. Toss everything together until steaming hot and serve immediately."],"tags":["Quick","Family"],"image":0},{"id":"potato-salad","name":"Lemon potato & chickpea salad","time":25,"appliances":["Hob"],"diet":"vegan","items":[["potato",180],["chickpeas",120],["cucumber",60],["oil",5],["lemon",0.25]],"steps":["Wash and dice potatoes. Simmer in a pan of water until tender.","Drain and let steam dry. Rinse the chickpeas and dice the cucumber.","Mix lemon juice and oil to make a dressing.","Combine potatoes, chickpeas and cucumber with the dressing. Serve warm or cool."],"tags":["Fresh","Family"],"image":2},{"id":"cheese-wrap","name":"Crispy cheese & spinach wraps","time":15,"appliances":["Hob"],"diet":"vegetarian","items":[["wraps",2],["cheese",40],["spinach",70],["tomato",60]],"steps":["Wash the spinach and tomato. Dice the tomato and grate the cheese.","Wilt the spinach in a pan with a splash of water. Drain excess water.","Place spinach, tomato and cheese inside each wrap and fold over.","Warm each folded wrap in a dry frying pan, turning once, until crisp and the cheese has melted."],"tags":["Quick","Comfort"],"image":1},{"id":"simple-rice","name":"Chickpea & spinach rice","time":25,"appliances":["Hob"],"diet":"vegan","items":[["rice",60],["chickpeas",120],["spinach",60],["onion",30],["oil",5]],"steps":["Rinse rice, spinach and drained chickpeas. Dice the onion.","Soften onion in the oil. Add rice and cook with water according to the rice packet.","When rice is almost ready, fold in the chickpeas and spinach. Cover and heat through.","Check that the rice is tender. Rest for a few minutes, fluff and serve."],"tags":["Family","Comfort"],"image":0}]'::jsonb) x cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(x->'items') with ordinality as i(value,ordinality);
